' ========================================
' LEGEND
' ========================================
legend right
    |= Symbol |= Meaning |
    | --> | Direct association |
    | ..> | Reference/dependency |
    | 1:1 | One-to-one |
    | 1:n | One-to-many |
    | n:1 | Many-to-one |
    
    **Object Instance Notation:**
    :ClassName represents anonymous instance
    objectName:ClassName for named instance
endlegend

